    "ciesin:sedac_doi": "10.7927/a4mb-4t86",
    "ciesin:purpose": "To provide daily 8-hour maximum and annual ground-level Ozone (O3) concentration data in the U.S. at a resolution of 1 km (about 30 arc-seconds) for public health research to respectively estimate short- and long-term effects on human health, and for other related research.",
